    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">The Evolution of High-Tech Industry</title>
      <p>The high-tech industry has experienced rapid growth and innovation, with advancements driven by digital transformation, AI, and automation. From early computing systems to the current era of quantum computing, the industry has consistently pushed the boundaries of what technology can achieve, changing the way we interact with the world.</p>
