    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">The Rise of Digital Technologies</title>
      <p>Digital technologies, such as personal computers, smartphones, and the internet, revolutionized how information is processed and shared. The continuous miniaturization of hardware and the explosion of digital platforms have shaped the modern tech landscape.</p>
