      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Growth of the Hi-Tech Market</title>
      <p>The global high-tech market is expanding rapidly as digital transformation accelerates across industries. Advancements in AI, cloud computing, 5G connectivity, and automation are driving unprecedented growth, with industries such as healthcare, finance, and manufacturing adopting cutting-edge technologies to improve efficiency and outcomes.</p>
    </section>
