    <section>
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Government Regulations and Support</title>
      <p>Governments around the world are implementing policies and regulations to foster innovation in the high-tech sector. This includes funding for research and development, tax incentives for sustainable tech, and regulations aimed at data security, privacy, and ethical AI use. These efforts are helping accelerate the adoption of new technologies and driving economic growth in the tech industry.</p>
